# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-2QK4P.1.1.1-endpoint`.
#
# The PRODUCTION path for F2 and F3, split into its own artifact because they
# live in the api binary and the filter wide enough to catch them alongside the
# unit regressions also catches
# `api::tests::recovery_reattaches_tmux_session_when_handle_exists`, a
# registered flake (TASK-X0PV1) — and a pinned signature must not depend on a
# flake's mood. `--exact` for the same reason.
#
# `env -u ...` because a dispatch leaks its run id and home into subprocesses,
# and these tests build their own Home under a temp root that must see neither.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-daemon --lib -- --exact api::tests::one_recover_post_enumerates_the_project_once api::tests::an_invalid_action_answers_400_even_while_the_enumeration_is_unresolved --test-threads=1
